 "about": "North Macedonia: the Government decision on tolls (Службен весник 118/2019, art. 5) gives the tolls per toll station only as images on page 4 of its PDF (euro, paid in cash). Transcribed by hand from that table, in its order; tools/tables fetches the PDF again and says if it has changed (sha256). Columns: vehicle categories IA, IБ, II, III, IV. Art. 5 was first changed by Службен весник 88/2025 (its preamble names 118/19 alone), so this table applies until 30 April 2025. The 2019 table prints Романовци for the station OpenStreetMap and the 2025 table name Романовце.",
